  "title": "pcapng: fixed format specifier for result of sizeof",
  "description": "On Ubuntu, !19734 introduced a compilation warning (escalated to error) due to the the format specifier not matching the result of `sizeof`\n\n```\npcapng-darwin-custom.c: In function ‘pcapng_read_darwin_legacy_block’:\npcapng-darwin-custom.c:380:38: error: format ‘%lu’ expects argument of type ‘long unsigned int’, but argument 3 has type ‘unsigned int’ [-Werror=format=]\n```\n\ncc @alagoutte",
